note: random numbers: the same every run after "use the same random numbers every time"
use the same random numbers every time.
let rolls be an empty list of numbers
repeat 10 times:
    add (a random number from 1 to 6) to the end of rolls
say rolls
let low be 7
let high be 0
repeat 1000 times:
    let n be a random number from 1 to 6
    if n is below low, set low to n
    if n is above high, set high to n
say "From " followed by low followed by " to " followed by high
let d be a random decimal between 0 and 1
say d is at least 0 and d is below 1
say a random decimal between 5 and 5
say a random number from -2 to -2
let cards be a list of "ace", "king", "queen" and "jack"
say pick one of cards
say a random item of cards
say a random item in cards
let shuffled cards be cards shuffled
say shuffled cards
say cards
shuffle cards
say cards
say the number of items in cards
say roll a die
let total be 0
repeat 600 times:
    add roll a die to total
say total is above 1800 and total is below 2400
